   "type": "text",
   "x": 1428.7,
   "y": 1024,
   "width": 390.0,
   "height": 112.5,
   "text": "No tag has been cut. A source build prints the Go\npseudo-version v0.0.0-20260907003604-8470a17833e7 —\n38 characters, which will not sit in this header\nbeside anything else. The header needs a short form:\nthe tag where one exists, the commit where none\ndoes.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
